{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A not-quite-turn-based battle system</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate strategic options while avoiding real-time attacks!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133470/extras/db1dfdca286e5bb7ce2fa6da2449aa99.poster.avif?t=1761935371\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133470/extras/db1dfdca286e5bb7ce2fa6da2449aa99.webm?t=1761935371\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133470/extras/db1dfdca286e5bb7ce2fa6da2449aa99.mp4?t=1761935371\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Equippable abilities for your character and your magic pencil</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Swap them out anytime and try different combinations!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133470/extras/57f1935be1b289f8a0c5ee9e3abdb23f.poster.avif?t=1761935371\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133470/extras/57f1935be1b289f8a0c5ee9e3abdb23f.webm?t=1761935371\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133470/extras/57f1935be1b289f8a0c5ee9e3abdb23f.mp4?t=1761935371\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >An expressive moveset</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An expressive moveset that lets you twirl, dive, and flip to your heart's content!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133470/extras/bddb82858836e8203ab8d684bd9d550c.poster.avif?t=1761935371\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133470/extras/bddb82858836e8203ab8d684bd9d550c.webm?t=1761935371\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133470/extras/bddb82858836e8203ab8d684bd9d550c.mp4?t=1761935371\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Control nearby objects</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Switch up the gameplay when you get tired of guiding this bozo around!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133470/extras/e785bd860e7db8937d9d2f540e068610.poster.avif?t=1761935371\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133470/extras/e785bd860e7db8937d9d2f540e068610.webm?t=1761935371\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133470/extras/e785bd860e7db8937d9d2f540e068610.mp4?t=1761935371\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Planned features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An involved story that spans multiple chapters! Stop the planet-destroying Lord Doomon, and learn more about him...</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A new planet to explore in each chapter. Mythical islands and futuristic cities await!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple fun characters to follow you around, help you fight, and let you use cool abilities!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The free demo will expand to include all of Chapter 1 in 2026. The full game is planned to release sometime this decade.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"To Be Continued","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steam